      weilSliceColimTrianglePullHom.{u} (@hc_all) (@hr_all) hSite
        (π_lvl j) (π_lvl i) (vX θ) (hvX θ) F₀ q (toH (π_lvl i) (fromH (π_lvl i) x_i)) at h2
    rw [hθ0, map_zero, hto_from (π_lvl i) x_i] at h2
